# Tiffin Service (Subscription Orders) - Perfect Implementation Plan

This plan is tailored specifically to the `Tifora` codebase. 

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Zero Disruption Guarantee:** To guarantee that the current standard ordering flow never breaks, the Tiffin Service will be built as an entirely separate module. We will not modify the complex logic in `order.model.js`. Instead, we will create a dedicated `tiffin` submodule in the backend and dedicated Tiffin pages in the frontend (User, Restaurant, DeliveryV2, Admin).

## User Review Required (Policy Decisions)

> [!WARNING]
> These edge cases require a business policy decision from you. Please review:
> 
> 1. **Cancellation & Refunds:** If a user cancels mid-plan, do we refund the prorated amount to their wallet, or is it strictly non-refundable? *(Recommendation: Prorated refund to User Wallet minus a small cancellation fee).*
> 2. **Restaurant Holidays:** If a restaurant marks tomorrow as a "Holiday", should the system automatically pause all active tiffins for that day and extend their subscription by 1 day? *(Recommendation: Yes, this prevents missed deliveries).*
> 3. **Delivery Boy Assignment Rejection:** If a delivery boy rejects the manual 10-20 tiffin assignment, it will revert to "unassigned". Does the restaurant get a push notification/alarm? *(Recommendation: Yes, ring the `NewOrderNotification` alarm for the restaurant).*

