## 1. Backend Architecture (Isolated Module)

We will create a new directory: `Backend/src/modules/food/tiffin/`

### Models (`/models/`)
1. **`tiffinPlan.model.js`:** Restaurant creates this. Fields: `restaurantId`, `name`, `durationDays` (e.g., 7, 30), `mealType` (Morning, Evening, Both), `price`, `itemsDescription`.
2. **`tiffinSubscription.model.js`:** User purchases this upfront. Fields: `userId`, `restaurantId`, `planId`, `startDate`, `endDate`, `deliveryAddress`, `status` (active, paused, cancelled, expired), `paymentId`.
3. **`tiffinDelivery.model.js`:** The actual daily drop-off. Fields: `subscriptionId`, `type` (Morning/Evening), `date`, `status` (pending, assigned, out_for_delivery, delivered, failed), `assignedTo` (Delivery Partner), `verification` (OTP or PictureUrl).

### Controllers & Routes (`/controllers/`, `/routes/`)
- **`userTiffin.controller.js`:** Browse plans, Upfront Checkout (Razorpay/Wallet integration), View My Subscriptions, Pause/Resume Subscription.
- **`restaurantTiffin.controller.js`:** Manage Plans (CRUD), View Daily Prep Count (Morning/Evening), Bulk Manual Assignment of `tiffinDelivery` to a specific delivery boy.
- **`deliveryTiffin.controller.js`:** Fetch assigned tiffins (sorted by `$near` proximity), Update status, Upload verification picture.
- **`adminTiffin.controller.js`:** View all subscriptions, Manage Delivery Boy Payouts specifically for Tiffin drops.

### Automated Tasks (`/scripts/tiffinScheduler.js`)
- A midnight Cron Job that queries active `TiffinSubscriptions` and generates `TiffinDelivery` records for the upcoming day. (Skips users who have "paused" their subscription).

