## 2. Frontend Architecture (Isolated Components)

We will inject new routes into the existing Routers without touching existing pages.

### User App (`Frontend/src/modules/Food/pages/user/Tiffin/`)
- **New Pages:** `TiffinHome.jsx` (List of restaurants offering tiffins), `TiffinPlanDetails.jsx`, `TiffinCheckout.jsx`, `MySubscriptions.jsx`.
- **Integration:** Add a distinct "Tiffin Service" banner/button on the main User Home page.

### Restaurant Dashboard (`Frontend/src/modules/Food/pages/restaurant/Tiffin/`)
- **New Pages:** `TiffinSettings.jsx` (Create plans), `TiffinPrepDashboard.jsx` (Shows how many to cook today), `TiffinDispatchPanel.jsx` (Manual assignment by zone).
- **Integration:** Add a new tab to `RestaurantSidebar.jsx`.

### Delivery App (`Frontend/src/modules/DeliveryV2/pages/Tiffin/`)
- **New Pages:** `TiffinRouteList.jsx` (List of 10-20 assigned orders sorted by nearest distance), `TiffinDropoff.jsx` (Map view, Call User, OTP/Picture Upload).
- **Integration:** Add a "Tiffin Route" tab in the `DeliveryV2Router.jsx` bottom nav. 

### Admin App (`Frontend/src/modules/Food/pages/admin/Tiffin/`)
- **New Pages:** `TiffinPayouts.jsx` (Track how many tiffins a delivery boy delivered and calculate their earnings separately from standard orders).

